Subject: [PATCH] nghttp2: enable RFC3542 cmsg macros on iOS

Darwin hides the IPv6 packet-info control-message helpers behind
__APPLE_USE_RFC_3542. Enable that API surface before nghttp2 includes the
network headers.

diff -ruN -U0 --exclude=*.bak a/src/util.cc b/src/util.cc
--- a/src/util.cc	2024-04-04 01:42:44
+++ b/src/util.cc	2026-07-05 00:14:01
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+#define __APPLE_USE_RFC_3542 1
